      "side": 1,
      "message": "`favicon.ico` is added to `resources/com/google/gitiles/static/favicon.ico` and mentioned in the commit message, but `gitiles.FAVICON_ICO_URL` is omitted from `STATIC_URL_GLOBALS`.\n\nBecause Gitiles serves static assets under `+static/` rather than the repository/site root, browsers and tools will not discover `+static/favicon.ico` unless it is exposed in the templates via `\u003clink rel\u003d\"icon\" href\u003d\"{$staticUrls.FAVICON_ICO_URL}\" sizes\u003d\"any\"\u003e` (or similar fallback).\n\nConsider adding `gitiles.FAVICON_ICO_URL` to `STATIC_URL_GLOBALS` and declaring it in `Common.soy` and `Doc.soy` (as well as checking it in `FaviconTest`), or documenting if `favicon.ico` is intended strictly for direct static requests.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "5c691e2c43e8dc479f2d13ca47df71f7fa270524",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
