      "side": 1,
      "message": "By default browsers fetch manifests without credentials. On Gitiles instances behind auth or SSO, this unauthenticated request gets redirected to login and logs a manifest syntax error in the browser console. If we keep the manifest, we should add crossorigin\u003d\"use-credentials\" on the link tag, or we could just drop site.webmanifest entirely since Gitiles is not really an installable PWA.",
